    "turn_text": "I think it's part of it that this president needs to be held account, at least in terms of his reputation. But I would fall back to this will have consequences for the president, I believe, in terms of election. I think the people's perception of this president in this light is one of the reasons we won back the House of Representatives. And again, the policy differences. Let's remember what he did by limiting military assistance to an ally at war, besides destroying our reputation and the trust that might be there for our other allies, he imperiled them and therefore our own national security. So I think there's multiple reasons you hold this president accountable. What my friend from California was saying was just one of them.",
